### Phase 10 — Button Alignment & Placement (Global)
Buttons are the most critical interactive element. The current codebase has inconsistent alignment, sizing, and placement across pages.

#### [MODIFY] [main.css](file:///c:/Users/HSEF%202026/Downloads/Hilgodonlineshop/frontend/css/main.css) — `.btn` system

**Problems identified:**
- Some buttons are not full-width on mobile (e.g. PDP "Add to Cart" + "Buy Now" sit side-by-side on 375px)
- CTAs in hero, sell-banner, and auth pages are not centred on mobile
- Icon-only buttons (`btn-icon`) have no minimum tap size enforced
- The `btn-sm` padding is `7px 16px` — too small for touch (under 44px height)
- Buttons inside flex rows wrap unpredictably on narrow screens
- Action button groups (e.g. in admin rows) overflow rather than stack

**Rules to add to `.btn` system:**

| Scenario | Mobile rule | Desktop rule |
|----------|-------------|--------------|
| Primary CTA (single) | `width: 100%` | `width: auto` |
| Button pair (e.g. Add to Cart + Buy Now) | Stack vertically, both `width: 100%` | Side by side, `flex: 1` |
| Icon + text button (`btn-sm`) | Min height `44px` | Default |
| Inline text-link button (account nav, dropdowns) | Full row tap area `min-height: 44px` | Normal |
| Admin row action buttons | Stack or collapse to icon-only | Icon + label |

**Specific fixes per page:**

- **Home hero**: `"Shop Now"` + `"Flash Deals"` buttons → stack to full-width column on `< 480px`
- **PDP actions**: `"Add to Cart"` + `"Buy Now"` → `flex-direction: column` + `width: 100%` on `< 640px`
- **Cart summary**: `"Proceed to Checkout"` → always `width: 100%` on all sizes
- **Checkout**: `"Place Order"` → `width: 100%`, vertically centred in summary card
- **Auth pages** (Login/Signup): Submit buttons → `width: 100%`, `min-height: 48px`
- **Track order**: `"Track"` button → full-width below input on `< 640px`
- **Seller zone / Delivery apply**: Apply / Register buttons → `width: 100%` on mobile
- **Account panel**: Edit, Save, Cancel → right-aligned row on desktop, stacked full-width on `< 640px`
- **Mobile menu**: All nav links → minimum `48px` tap area
- **Product card**: `"Add to Cart"` button → `height: 40px`, full card width on mobile
- **Sell banner**: CTA button → `width: 100%` on `< 480px`
- **Flash sale header**: `"View All"` link-button → stays visible and does not overlap countdown
- **Admin table actions** (approve, reject, edit, delete): Collapse to icon-only buttons on `< 768px`, with tooltips
- **Pagination buttons**: Shrink `page-btn` from `38px` to `32px` on `< 480px`; reduce visible page numbers to 3

**New utility classes to add:**
```css
/* Buttons go full-width on mobile */
.btn-mobile-full { width: 100%; }
@media (min-width: 640px) { .btn-mobile-full { width: auto; } }

/* Button group: stacks on mobile, row on sm+ */
.btn-group {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: var(--space-2);
  width: 100%;
}
@media (min-width: 480px) {
  .btn-group { flex-direction: row; width: auto; }
  .btn-group .btn { flex: 1; }
}

/* Minimum touch target for small buttons */
.btn-sm { min-height: 44px; }
```

