## Key Patterns Used

### Fluid Typography with `clamp()`
```css
.hero-title { font-size: clamp(1.1rem, 5vw, 2.6rem); }
.section-title { font-size: clamp(1rem, 3vw, 1.4rem); }
```

### Responsive Grid Shorthand
All multi-column grids will use auto-fill where semantically appropriate:
```css
.categories-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); /* mobile */
}
@media (min-width: 480px) { grid-template-columns: repeat(5, 1fr); }
@media (min-width: 992px) { grid-template-columns: repeat(8, 1fr); }
```

### Touch Targets
All interactive buttons/links will have a minimum tap target of `44×44px` on mobile.

